Required Commands:


First Go to folder of Kafka in the windows C where ever you installed it

==> Starting zookeeper
.\bin\windows\zookeeper-server-start.bat .\config\zookeeper.properties

==> Starting Kafka server
.\bin\windows\kafka-server-start.bat .\config\server.properties

==> Creating topic - here we are topic name as test
.\bin\windows\kafka-topics.bat --create --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --replication-factor 1 --partition 1 --topic test


==> For checking how many topics are up
.\bin\windows\kafka-topics.bat --list --bootstrap-server localhost:9092


==> Creating producer
.\bin\windows\kafka-console-producer.bat --broker-list localhost:9092 --topic test


==> Creating consumer
.\bin\windows\kafka-console-consumer.bat --topic test --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --from-beginning